{
 "esm": "1.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "physics_step300_atmos_inputs",
  "description": "Atmospheric column state of SCM step 300 as bl_ysu_run receives it (KERNEL-level dump ysu/scm_ref_600.json, tile column 0: theta = tx/pi2d, p2d, p2di, pi2d, ze = cumsum of dz8w2d), as the input_<x> rewrite-target library injected at the YSU mount edge of couplings/physics_column*.esm (esm-spec 9.7.10); unlike scm_step300_atmos_inputs.esm it does NOT define input_rthraten, which the assembly couples in from the radiation subassembly. Generated numbers, hand-authored structure.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "assembly-inputs",
   "coupling"
  ]
 },
